       <h1>Bigg Boss 20: Salman Khan urges censorship on social media, raises concern over AI deepfakes; says, “I am going to take this up very seriously”</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Bollywood</span> <span>#Bigg Boss 20</span> <span>#Salman Khan</span> <span>#AI Deepfakes</span></div>
       <p>During the latest episode of *Bigg Boss 20*, host Salman Khan warned of the growing misuse of artificial intelligence on social media platforms. Khan highlighted the creation of fake videos and manipulated audio that feature public figures, noting that he himself has been depicted in AI‑generated content. He called for legal action against those responsible for such deepfakes and urged stricter censorship to curb the spread of misinformation. The actor‑host emphasized that the issue is a serious threat to personal reputation and public discourse, stating, “I am going to take this up very seriously.” While specific legislative measures were not detailed, Khan’s comments underscore a broader industry concern about the impact of AI‑driven media manipulation. The remarks come amid heightened scrutiny of digital content authenticity across entertainment and news sectors. </p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-28/bigg-boss-20-salman-khan-urges-censorship-on-social-media-ra.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>What to watch: Salman Khan’s call for tighter AI regulation is likely to shape future discussions on digital ethics in Indian media.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article accurately reflects the source material and maintains the tone of the original report.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.bollywoodhungama.com/news/features/bigg-boss-20-salman-khan-urges-censorship-on-social-media-raises-concern-over-ai-deepfakes-says-i-am-going-to-take-this-up-very-seriously/" rel="noopener">Bollywood Hungama</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
