      <ul><li><a href="https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNVHFWR1ZqZXBzc1R2T1ZTb2owellKaTRESjVIc3hwVXZWRzVUU1JCWEdsNkIzV1QwNHlrYllDMUU3SVZFWkRnU3ItWnViLXVCS2w5cFZFbURoTkxna3BmbXN3OTFkeGdJcE54RmlyRS15V3dMczJBVTZTcGs4Z1Z4eGlmQW0welpsaEppZUppMHpDR2FUSmVfdFV6S3d3N2NlRFhFbGxB?oc=5" rel="noopener">Education (aggregate)</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
