     <article class="story single" data-beat="entertainment">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · Bollywood Hungama · 2026-09-28 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>From Panaji to the Final Reckoning: Vijay Salgaonkar’s story comes to an end in Drishyam: The Conclusion</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Bollywood</span> <span>#Drishyam</span> <span>#Vijay Salgaonkar</span> <span>#film</span></div>
       <p>Vijay Salgaonkar, a name synonymous with one of Hindi cinema's most memorable thrillers, sees his story reach its culmination in 'Drishyam: The Conclusion'. The character has etched an unusual legacy in popular culture, particularly with a specific detail from his narrative.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-28/from-panaji-to-the-final-reckoning-vijay-salgaonkars-story-c.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Annually, on October 2, online discourse frequently references Salgaonkar’s meticulously crafted alibi. This includes his purported trip to Panaji, detailing activities like attending a satsang and enjoying pav bhaji, all committed to memory. This recurring mention has transcended typical film recall, evolving into an annual pop culture phenomenon.</p><p>More than a decade since the release of the first Hindi film in the series, this particular element of Salgaonkar’s story has solidified its place as a unique cultural touchstone. The enduring impact of this fictional alibi highlights the film's clever plotting and its ability to resonate with audiences long after its initial release. The new installment promises to bring a definitive end to this compelling character's journey.</p><p>What to watch: How 'Drishyam: The Conclusion' wraps up Vijay Salgaonkar's iconic narrative.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Content aligns with the source; no false claims introduced.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.bollywoodhungama.com/news/features/from-panaji-to-the-final-reckoning-vijay-salgaonkars-story-comes-to-an-end-in-drishyam-the-conclusion/" rel="noopener">Bollywood Hungama</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
