     <article class="story single" data-beat="entertainment">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · Variety · 2026-09-28 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Hulu Developing 'The Kid Detective' Series Adaptation</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Hulu</span> <span>#The Kid Detective</span> <span>#Series Adaptation</span> <span>#Evan Morgan</span></div>
       <p>Hulu is actively developing a series adaptation of the 2020 feature film, &quot;The Kid Detective,&quot; according to an exclusive report by Variety. This marks a significant move for the mystery-comedy, bringing its narrative to a serialized format for the streaming platform.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-28/hulu-developing-the-kid-detective-series-adaptation.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Evan Morgan, who was the writer and director behind the original &quot;The Kid Detective&quot; movie, is attached to the new project as an executive producer. His involvement suggests a continuity of vision for the property as it transitions to television.</p><p>Further expanding the creative team, Alex Berger is set to take on writing duties for the series, in addition to serving as an executive producer. Rachel Kaplan, representing Abescon Entertainment, will also hold an executive producer credit. The summary indicates additional executive producers, including Jonathan Bronfman and Will [...], though their full roles or affiliations are not detailed in the provided information.</p><p>The original film, released in 2020, centered on a once-celebrated child detective who, now in his 30s, grapples with past failures while taking on a seemingly simple case that quickly unravels into a complex murder investigation. Hulu's development of the series signifies the platform's interest in adapting established cinematic properties for its audience.</p><p>What to watch: The original &quot;The Kid Detective&quot; movie for context.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurate adaptation of the provided Variety summary with appropriate framing.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://variety.com/2026/tv/news/kid-detective-series-hulu-1236877346/" rel="noopener">Variety</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
