      <ul><li><a href="https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/policy/india-poised-to-globally-lead-next-generation-of-medical-practices-jitendra-singh/134533718" rel="noopener">ET Healthworld</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
