      <ul><li><a href="https://www.indiatoday.in/india/video/sp-chief-to-skip-india-bloc-meet-seat-sharing-rift-with-congress-and-opposition-strategy-over-cec-ytvd-3004556-2026-09-28?utm_source=rss" rel="noopener">India Today</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
