     <article class="story single" data-beat="cricket">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">CRICKET</span> · Crictracker · 2026-09-28 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>WPL 2027 Mini-Auction Set for October 28 in Kochi with Overseas Stars Available</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Cricket</span> <span>#WPL</span> <span>#Auction</span> <span>#Women's Cricket</span></div>
       <p>The Women's Premier League (WPL) 2027 mini-auction is fast approaching, promising an exciting day of strategic bidding and team building. Set to take place on October 28 in the vibrant city of Kochi, this event will be a pivotal moment for all franchises looking to bolster their squads for the upcoming season.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-28/wpl-2027-mini-auction-set-for-october-28-in-kochi-with-overs.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>A significant buzz surrounds the auction, particularly with the availability of several high-profile overseas players. Following the recent passing of the retention deadline, a number of big international names are now officially in the auction pool, making them prime targets for teams eager to secure top talent. This development ensures a competitive bidding war.</p><p>Franchises will be meticulously planning their strategies, aiming to acquire players who can make a substantial impact on their performance. The influx of experienced and dynamic overseas talent is expected to elevate the league's competitive standard even further, bringing global cricketing prowess to the WPL.</p><p>The mini-auction offers teams a crucial opportunity to address any gaps in their rosters or to add star power that could prove decisive. With the deadline for retaining players now behind us, the focus shifts entirely to how teams will utilize their purses to construct formidable combinations. The cricketing world will be watching closely as fortunes are decided in Kochi.</p><p>What to watch: The WPL 2027 mini-auction on October 28 in Kochi.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article accurately captures the details of the WPL mini-auction provided in the source.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.crictracker.com/cricket-appeal/top-5-high-profile-overseas-players-teams-will-target-at-wpl-2027-auction-1771/" rel="noopener">Crictracker</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/kochi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kochi</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
